{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.enforcement","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Rules, Violations & Fines","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium rule-adoption and fine due-process framework. Rule text, violation facts, hearing procedures, fine schedules, and case outcomes are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_rule_enforcement","as_of_date":"2026-09-17","admission_rule":"Only current-effective statewide Illinois condominium rule-adoption and fine-process requirements are Infrastructure. Association-specific rule text, notice methods, hearing procedures, schedules, findings, and remedies are instance data."},"categories":[{"id":"enforcement.rules","label":"Rule adoption and amendment"},{"id":"enforcement.violations","label":"Violation administration"},{"id":"enforcement.fines","label":"Fines and hearing process"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-18","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18(k)-(l)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18","summary":"Bylaws must address use restrictions designed to prevent unreasonable interference and the method of adopting/amending administrative rules."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18-4-h","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.4(h)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.4","summary":"Board rule adoption/amendment requires a unit-owner meeting for discussion; notice contains the full proposed text; no quorum unless condominium instruments require one."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18-4-l","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.4(l)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.4","summary":"Late-payment charges are distinct from reasonable fines; fines require notice and an opportunity to be heard."}],"pages":[{"id":"rules-violations-fines","title":"Rules, Violations & Fines","help":"The statewide framework establishes how rules are adopted and the minimum process before a fine. The association supplies the actual rules, procedures, notices, findings, and amounts.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-enforcement-framework","title":"Statewide rules and fine framework","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18","il-condo-act-18-4-h","il-condo-act-18-4-l"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"bylaw-use-restriction-framework","kind":"notice","text":"The bylaws must provide for restrictions and requirements respecting use and maintenance of units and use of common elements, not otherwise set forth in the declaration, that are designed to prevent unreasonable interference with other unit owners' use of their units and the common elements.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"bylaw-rule-method-framework","kind":"notice","text":"The bylaws must provide the method for adopting and amending administrative rules and regulations governing operation and use of the common elements.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"rule-discussion-meeting-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Before adopting or amending rules and regulations covering operation and use of the property, the board must call a meeting of unit owners for the specific purpose of discussing the proposed rules and regulations.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-h"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"full-text-notice-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Notice of the rule-discussion meeting must contain the full text of the proposed rules and regulations.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-h"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"rule-meeting-quorum-rule","kind":"notice","text":"No quorum is required at the unit-owner rule-discussion meeting unless the declaration, bylaws, or other condominium instrument expressly provides otherwise.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-h"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"fine-due-process-rule","kind":"notice","text":"A reasonable fine for violation of the declaration, bylaws, or association rules and regulations may be levied only after notice and an opportunity to be heard.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-l"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"late-charge-fine-boundary","kind":"notice","text":"Section 18.4(l) separately authorizes charges for late payment of common expenses or other lawfully agreed expenses and reasonable fines for violations. A late-payment charge and a violation fine are therefore distinct administrative categories.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-l"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"no-universal-fine-notice-period","kind":"notice","text":"Section 18.4(l) requires notice and an opportunity to be heard before a fine but does not itself state a universal numeric notice period. Any particular notice period or hearing procedure must therefore be established from the association's governing documents, adopted rules, or other applicable authority.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-l"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":7,"span":6}}]},{"id":"association-rule-inventory","title":"Association rule inventory","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18","il-condo-act-18-4-h"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"rulebook-reference","kind":"text","label":"Current rulebook / rules reference","binding":"association.enforcement.rulebook_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"rule-adoption-procedure-reference","kind":"text","label":"Bylaw rule-adoption procedure reference","binding":"association.enforcement.rule_adoption_procedure_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"rulebook-last-reviewed","kind":"date","label":"Rulebook last reviewed","binding":"association.enforcement.rulebook_last_reviewed","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"association-rules","kind":"collection","label":"Current rules and regulations","binding":"association.enforcement.rules","min_items":0,"item_label":"Rule","actions":{"add_label":"Add rule","remove_label":"Remove rule"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"rule-identifier","kind":"text","label":"Rule identifier","binding":"identifier","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"rule-title","kind":"text","label":"Rule title","binding":"title","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":3}},{"id":"rule-category","kind":"text","label":"Category","binding":"category","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"rule-effective-date","kind":"date","label":"Effective date","binding":"effective_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"rule-status","kind":"select","label":"Status","binding":"status","options":[{"value":"current","label":"Current"},{"value":"superseded","label":"Superseded"},{"value":"proposed","label":"Proposed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"rule-text-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Rule text / document reference","binding":"text_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"rule-discussion-meeting-date","kind":"date","label":"Discussion meeting date","binding":"discussion_meeting_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":2}},{"id":"rule-meeting-notice-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Meeting notice / full-text reference","binding":"meeting_notice_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"rule-governing-document-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Governing-document authority","binding":"governing_document_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}}]}]},{"id":"violation-cases","title":"Violation and hearing cases","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-l"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"violation-cases-collection","kind":"collection","label":"Violation cases","binding":"association.enforcement.violation_cases","min_items":0,"item_label":"Violation case","actions":{"add_label":"Add violation case","remove_label":"Remove violation case"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"violation-unit-reference","kind":"text","label":"Unit reference","binding":"unit_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-subject-role","kind":"select","label":"Subject","binding":"subject_role","options":[{"value":"owner","label":"Unit owner"},{"value":"tenant","label":"Tenant"},{"value":"guest_invitee","label":"Guest / invitee"},{"value":"other","label":"Other"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-rule-reference","kind":"text","label":"Rule / instrument reference","binding":"rule_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":3}},{"id":"violation-occurrence-date","kind":"date","label":"Occurrence date","binding":"occurrence_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-status","kind":"select","label":"Case status","binding":"status","options":[{"value":"reported","label":"Reported"},{"value":"notice_sent","label":"Notice sent"},{"value":"hearing_offered","label":"Hearing offered"},{"value":"hearing_completed","label":"Hearing completed"},{"value":"resolved_no_fine","label":"Resolved — no fine"},{"value":"fine_levied","label":"Fine levied"},{"value":"withdrawn","label":"Withdrawn"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"violation-notice-date","kind":"date","label":"Notice date","binding":"notice_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-notice-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Notice reference","binding":"notice_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":3,"span":3}},{"id":"violation-hearing-offered-date","kind":"date","label":"Hearing offered","binding":"hearing_offered_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-hearing-date","kind":"date","label":"Hearing date","binding":"hearing_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-hearing-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Hearing record reference","binding":"hearing_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"violation-disposition","kind":"textarea","label":"Finding / disposition","binding":"disposition","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":5}},{"id":"violation-fine-amount","kind":"number","label":"Fine amount","binding":"fine_amount","min":0,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-fine-date","kind":"date","label":"Fine levied","binding":"fine_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"violation-case-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Case notes / evidence reference","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":10,"span":3}}]}]},{"id":"association-enforcement-configuration","title":"Association enforcement configuration","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-l"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"fine-schedule-reference","kind":"text","label":"Fine schedule reference","binding":"association.enforcement.fine_schedule_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"hearing-procedure-reference","kind":"text","label":"Hearing procedure reference","binding":"association.enforcement.hearing_procedure_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"violation-notice-procedure-reference","kind":"text","label":"Violation notice procedure reference","binding":"association.enforcement.notice_procedure_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"association-fine-notice-days","kind":"number","label":"Association-stated fine notice period","binding":"association.enforcement.fine_notice_days","min":0,"step":1,"unit":"days","format":"integer","help":"Association-specific value only. Section 18.4(l) itself does not supply a universal numeric notice period.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"hearing-decision-body","kind":"select","label":"Hearing / decision body","binding":"association.enforcement.hearing_decision_body","options":[{"value":"board","label":"Board"},{"value":"committee","label":"Committee"},{"value":"other","label":"Other"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"late-charge-policy-reference","kind":"text","label":"Late-charge policy reference","binding":"association.enforcement.late_charge_policy_reference","help":"Kept separate from violation-fine policy because Section 18.4(l) treats them as distinct categories.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"enforcement-configuration-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Enforcement configuration notes","binding":"association.enforcement.notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}}]}]}]}